 "notes": "Header page of Table XV Part II(A) (continued). First six rows (Panjabi..Shina) complete the Anantnag Tehsil block begun on leaf 259; 'Kashmir South' district brace printed on this page. Srinagar Tehsil block begins at the foot of the page (Dogri..Chabhali) and continues on leaf 261 (Pothwari..Shina). The printed rows are skewed: in the Panjabi/Kashmiri subsidiary columns each row sits about half a row-space lower than its stub label; rows were assigned by counting rows from the top and bottom of each block, and every assignment was cross-checked against the mother-tongue totals (e.g. the Awantipura 20/4/16 Kashmiri entry must belong to Balti (MT 40), not Ladakhi (MT 2)). Remarks column blank."
